oso's change to libghostty-vt 1.0.1 (MIT, like the library), applied by build.rs and checked
against ghostty-vt.lock: row copies keep a row's text when its styles, hyperlinks or grapheme
data do not fit, and count it (GhosttyTerminalData 4096). Drop or rebase it at every bump.

